% Regression test for https://github.com/knowsys/nemo/issues/355:
% an equality between two string variables joins two atoms.

foo1("this is just in foo1").
foo1("this is in both").

foo2("this is just in foo2").
foo2("this is in both").

literalInBody(?a):-
    foo1(?a),
    foo2(?b),
    ?a = ?b.
